  "extra_prompt": "You are booking for a wedding or event planner. Ask about the event type, date, guest count, budget range, and venue. Ask about the level of support wanted (full planning, styling, or on-the-day coordination). Quote prices only from the reference answers, and say the final price is confirmed after consultation. Do not promise specific vendor availability or a fixed total budget outcome.",
  "kb": [
    {
      "q": "How much do you charge?",
      "a": "{price_note} Pricing depends on the event type, guest count, and the services you need, such as styling or on-the-day coordination.",
      "keywords": "price,cost,fee,charge",
      "priority": 10
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do full wedding planning?",
      "a": "Yes, we plan the whole wedding from first booking to the day, including timeline, vendors, and budget. Partial planning is available if you only need help with some parts.",
      "keywords": "wedding,full planning,partial",
      "priority": 10
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do on-the-day coordination?",
      "a": "Yes, we run the day for couples who have planned the wedding themselves. We confirm the timeline with each vendor and manage the schedule on the day.",
      "keywords": "on the day,coordination,timeline",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do styling?",
      "a": "Yes, we style the venue and arrange hire items, then handle set-up and pack-down. We confirm what is included in your quote.",
      "keywords": "styling,hire,decor,set-up",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do corporate events?",
      "a": "Yes, we plan product launches, conferences, award nights, and team events, including the venue, run sheet, and speakers.",
      "keywords": "corporate,launch,conference,award",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you find vendors?",
      "a": "Yes, we source and book vendors such as venues, caterers, and photographers to suit your style and budget.",
      "keywords": "vendors,venue,caterer,photographer",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "How far in advance should I book?",
      "a": "Many weddings book nine to eighteen months ahead, especially for popular venues and dates. Corporate events and parties can often be arranged on shorter notice.",
      "keywords": "booking,advance,notice,date",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do destination weddings?",
      "a": "Yes, we plan destination weddings. Travel fees apply, and we show them in your quote so you can see the full cost.",
      "keywords": "destination,travel,overseas",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you manage the budget?",
      "a": "Yes, we build a budget with you, track every expense, and flag any cost that could push you over.",
      "keywords": "budget,expenses,cost",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you attend the event?",
      "a": "Yes, we attend weddings and larger events. Smaller events may only need remote coordination, which we agree on when you book.",
      "keywords": "attend,on site,remote",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "What is your cancellation policy?",
      "a": "Cancelling with less than {cancellation_notice} may forfeit the deposit.",
      "keywords": "cancel,policy,deposit",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you require a deposit?",
      "a": "{deposit_note} The deposit amount and payment dates are set out in your contract.",
      "keywords": "deposit,payment,contract",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Are you insured?",
      "a": "Our insurer is [insurer name] and our policy number is [policy number]. We can send a copy of the certificate before you book.",
      "keywords": "insured,insurance,certificate",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do set-up and pack-down?",
      "a": "Yes, we manage set-up and pack-down as part of styling and coordination. We confirm the hours needed when we quote.",
      "keywords": "set-up,pack-down,hours",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you offer a free consultation?",
      "a": "{consult_note} Bring your date, guest count, and budget so we can give you a useful first answer.",
      "keywords": "consultation,free,first meeting",
      "priority": 8
    }
  ],
